    "id": "s37",
    "kind": "--",
    "text": "Substituting _the vicar_ doesn’t preserve the open interrogative. A common-noun-headed phrase needs an interrogative constituent, as in _which vicar_. Both expressions have object function, but the construction also requires interrogative properties (Huddleston and Pullum 2002, Ch. 10, §§7.1, 7.9)."
  },
